sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Run as Updater run
    participant Host as GitHub / Azure DevOps
    participant Entra as Microsoft Entra ID
    participant API as Power Platform APIs
    Note over Run: authMode = Auto (default)
    Run->>Host: Request OIDC token (audience api://AzureADTokenExchange)
    Host-->>Run: Short-lived signed token for this repo, branch or service connection
    Run->>Entra: client_credentials + client_assertion (no secret)
    alt Federated credential matches
        Entra-->>Run: Access token
    else Refused on the first token and a secret exists
        Run->>Entra: client_credentials + client secret (backup)
        Entra-->>Run: Access token, warning in the log
    end
    Run->>API: Calls with the token, cached per API, renewed 5 min before expiry
